The source trees under `vendor/` are unmodified copies of the Cordis framework
and its foundation library as vendored by
[DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)
(`vendor/cordis`, `vendor/cosmokit`), which are in turn derived from:

- Cordis — https://github.com/cordiverse/cordis — MIT, Copyright (c) Shigma
- Cosmokit — https://github.com/shigma/cosmokit — MIT

Both keep their upstream `LICENSE` files. They are included only so this
repository can build a reproducible baseline; they are not modified here. The
patch under `patch/` is applied to `.work/patched/` at benchmark time and is the
only difference between the two measured trees.

If you only want the benchmark harness and the write-up, you can ignore
`vendor/` entirely and point the harness at your own Cordis checkout.
